# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
# Characters, inventory and equipment for the P1 panels (decision 0024 P1;
# docs/specs/character-panels.md §4.3, §6, §9; lua-plugin-api.md §15.1 checks 66 and 67):
# backpack size and bag ranges, items at chosen slots, quantities, conditions, the wallet,
# the player's level, scripted player and item properties named by dictionary labels, and
# the item interactions of the panels as input lines. Synthetic: it plays without an
# install (literal items; the labelled properties and slots stay unresolved and their
# steps are skipped). Every name and text is invented for Tessera.
tessera-scenario 1
title "Bags in order"
tick 50ms
player "Tamsin" level=7
item $loaf "Travel loaf" qty=6
item $rope "Coil of rope"
item $lamp "Shuttered lamp"
item $cloak "Grey cloak"
item $kettle "Tin kettle"

at 0s bag 30
+0s give $loaf slot=0
+0s give $rope slot=4
+0s give $lamp slot=29
+0s give $cloak
+0s wallet coin 1250
+0.1s quantity $loaf 5
+0s condition $lamp 0/80
+0s condition $rope 10/40
+0.1s level player 8
+0s stat player @Combat_Stats_CriticalPoints_Unified=12
+0s item-property $cloak @Item_Quality=3
+0s equip $cloak slot=@Chest
+0.2s bag 40
+0.1s bag 40
+0.1s give $kettle slot=35

input
at 0.6s move-item $rope to=backpack slot=10
at 0.7s split $loaf 2
at 0.8s destroy $lamp
at 0.9s move-item $kettle to=backpack slot=0
at 1s equip $cloak slot=@Chest
at 1.1s unequip $cloak
end
